s size slider now snaps to stops, tts default voice now follows the one picked in android settings\n- new animated startup screen that follows the color theme and dark mode\n- <follow up>\n- chapter sort now also sets reading order and read progress\n- split page indicator with a show whole page button in the reader, new back button hold animation, merged scanlators now count as one everywhere\n- redesigned add section popup, safe-only extensions for nsfw-free suggestions\n- crash fixes\n- bug fixes\n- redesigned popup menus across the app\n- added home page switching transition\n- draggable floating navbar selector and smoother tab switching animation\n- bigger extension icons in explore, swapped chapter buttons in rtl reading, smoother scrollbar dragging, fixed add to favourites buttons disappearing on long lists, minor ui improvements\n- fixed google drive sync and sign-out failing on renamed gmail accounts\n- <ignore>\n\n### Installation Instructions\n1. Download and install the apk file first\n2. Go to the Explore menu > Manage and click the pen icon to add an extension repo\n3. Install and use the extensions, read, add items to the favorites and ENJOY!\n\nIf this is your first time using the app, I recommend uninstalling any extension you find when opening the app for the first time and then installing latest extensions from your preferred repository.\n", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/HuzaifaKhalid1311/DropSauce/releases/434300003/reactions", "total_count": 10, "+1": 4, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 4, "eyes": 2}}}